column9:
First off, let me mention some of the positives;
1) The service was absolutely exceptional. The server that we had was really positive and ready to help whenever we had something to ask about; 2) As for the food itself, it was pretty good, it wasn't exceptional, hence the 4 star rating. The only downside was that the Beef Tagliata was a bit dry; and 3) The atmosphere and music was also quite pleasant and relaxing.
Now for the negatives;
1) It did take a bit of time for the water to arrive; 2) There was also the occasional shouting child or baby; and 3) The pricing is a bit high, but decent enough for the quality of meal and service received.
Aside from that and the downside of the Beef Tagliata being dry, there weren't that many negatives
Overall, it is a great place if you want to have a quick, healthy or a proper meal with friends and family.

